# Agent Andy — the three environment variables, and where each one is read.
# Andy runs with NO keys (see the Quickstart): keys only switch on the model paths.
# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) for the ElevenLabs key; export the
# others in your shell. Never commit a real value.

# Meta Model API: Muse Spark (brain), SAM 3.1 (eyes), Muse Voice Transcribe (voice in).
# Read from the ENVIRONMENT ONLY (agent/brain.py, agent/eyes.py, agent/voice.py):
#   export MODEL_API_KEY=...     # before ./start-andy.sh
MODEL_API_KEY=

# ElevenLabs voice out (agent/tts.py). Read from the environment, or from a
# gitignored .env.local in this folder with this one line filled in.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Chain-tip signing (receipts/signing.py): the path to Andy's private Ed25519 key.
# start-andy.sh sets it when ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_andy_chain exists; unset = UNSIGNED.
# ANDY_CHAIN_SIGNING_KEY=~/.ssh/id_ed25519_andy_chain
